rf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Grundy County record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them, the most of any pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, January to February came in at 29% of normal and June to July at 179%. Grid 26548 had its driest year in 1988 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
